==Trivia==
*This card is one of several featured in the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion's "Manaphy Travelogue" [[Space-Time Smackdown (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]], due to it featuring {{p|Manaphy}} in its artwork. A {{p|Staravia}} is also featured in the illustration rare print of the expansion's {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Manaphy|162}} card.

===Origin===
*{{m|Wing Attack}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Staravia}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

